<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mark_Waid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Mark Waid** (; born March 21, 1962) is an American [comic book writer](:Comic_book_writer) best known for his work on [DC Comics](:DC_Comics) titles *[The Flash](:The_Flash_%28comic_book%29)*, *[Kingdom Come](:Kingdom_Come_%28comics%29)* and *[Superman: Birthright](:Superman%3A_Birthright)* as well as his work on *[Captain America](:Captain_America_%28comic_book%29)*, *[Fantastic Four](:Fantastic_Four_%28comic_book%29)* and *[Daredevil](:Daredevil_%28Marvel_Comics_series%29)* for [Marvel](:Marvel_Comics). From August 2007 to December 2010, Waid served as Editor-in-Chief and later Chief Creative Officer of [Boom! Studios](:Boom%21_Studios), where he also published his creator-owned series *[Irredeemable](:Irredeemable)* and *[Incorruptible](:Incorruptible)*. In October 2018, Waid joined [Humanoids Publishing](:Humanoids_Publishing) as Director of Creative Development before being promoted to Publisher in February 2020. In addition to that, Waid has written for a variety of comics publishers, including [Fantagraphics](:Fantagraphics_Books), [Event](:Event_Comics), [Top Cow](:Top_Cow), [Dynamite](:Dynamite_Entertainment) and [Archie Comics](:Archie_Comics)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
