<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Matthew_Cable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Matthew Joseph Cable** is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character) appearing in [DC Comics](:DC_Comics)' *[Swamp Thing](:Swamp_Thing)* series. Introduced in *Swamp Thing* (Volume 1) in November 1972, he dies and is later resurrected as [Dream](:Dream_%28DC_Comics%29)'s raven in [Neil Gaiman](:Neil_Gaiman)'s rendition of *[The Sandman](:The_Sandman_%28Vertigo%29)*.Matt Cable was played by Henderson Wade in the [television series](:Swamp_Thing_%282019_TV_series%29) based on the comic book series of the same name for the [DC streaming service](:DC_Universe_%28streaming_service%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
