<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Angel_(Thomas_Halloway)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Angel** (**Thomas Halloway**, often shortened to **Tom Halloway**) is a [fictional superhero](:Fictional_superhero) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). Created by artist [Paul Gustavson](:Paul_Gustavson) and an unconfirmed writer during the [Golden Age of Comic Books](:Golden_Age_of_Comic_Books), the Angel [first appeared](:First_appeared) in *[Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Mystery_Comics)* #1 (Oct. 1939), the first publication of Marvel Comics' predecessor, [Timely Comics](:Timely_Comics).The Angel is a non-superpowered detective who nonetheless wore a superhero costume."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
