<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Deathwatch_(comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Deathwatch is a fictional character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The character is usually depicted as a demonic supervillain, most notably as an enemy of the third Ghost Rider, Danny Ketch."@en .
