<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Corvus_Glaive> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Corvus Glaive** is a fictional [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). He is a prominent member of the [Black Order](:Black_Order_%28comics%29), a team of aliens who work for [Thanos](:Thanos).The character has made several appearances in media, such as animated television series, video games, and the [Marvel Cinematic Universe](:Marvel_Cinematic_Universe) films *[Avengers: Infinity War](:Avengers%3A_Infinity_War)* and *[Avengers: Endgame](:Avengers%3A_Endgame)*, in which he was portrayed by [Michael James Shaw](:Michael_James_Shaw)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
