<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Kevin_Eastman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kevin Brooks Eastman (born May 30, 1962) is an American comic book artist and writer best known for co-creating Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles with Peter Laird. Eastman was also formerly the editor and publisher of the magazine Heavy Metal."@en .
