<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hornet_(comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Hornet is an identity used by five fictional characters appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. The characters appear in the Marvel Universe, two villains, and three heroes. Both the first and third versions have suffered from physical disabilities."@en .
