<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chuck_Austen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Chuck Austen** (born **Chuck Beckum**) is an American comic book [writer and artist](:Comics_creator), television writer and producer. In the comics industry, he is known for his work on *[U.S. War Machine](:U%2ES%2E_War_Machine)*, *[The Avengers](:The_Avengers_%28comic_book%29)*, *[JLA](:JLA_%28comic_book%29)*, *[Action Comics](:Action_Comics)* and the [X-Men](:X-Men) franchise, and in television, he is known for co-creating the animated TV series *[Tripping the Rift](:Tripping_the_Rift)* and producing the first season of *[Steven Universe](:Steven_Universe)* and acting as a co-showrunner on *[She-Ra and the Princesses of Power](:She-Ra_and_the_Princesses_of_Power)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
