<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mantra_(comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Mantra** is an American comic book series written by [Mike Barr](:Mike_W%2E_Barr), mainly penciled by [Terry Dodson](:Terry_Dodson) and published by [Malibu Comics](:Malibu_Comics) in the mid-1990s, until it was purchased by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). [Adam Hughes](:Adam_Hughes) is credited for the character designs. After the purchase, the title was cancelled after 24 issues and revamped in a new version, with a new protagonist.Mantra is the name of the lead character, an Ultra (superhero) within Malibu's [Ultraverse](:Ultraverse) line of comics."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
