<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Alan_Grant_(writer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Alan Grant** (9 February 1949 – 20 July 2022) was a British [comic book writer](:Comic_book_writer) known for writing [Judge Dredd](:Judge_Dredd) in *[2000 AD](:2000_AD_%28comics%29)* as well as various [Batman](:Batman) titles from the late 1980s to the early 2000s. He was the co-creator of the characters [Anarky](:Anarky), [Victor Zsasz](:Victor_Zsasz), and the [Ventriloquist](:Ventriloquist_%28comics%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
