<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Blockbuster_(DC_Comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Blockbuster** is the name of four supervillains and a criminal organization appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [DC Comics](:DC_Comics). The first one was primarily a foe of [Batman](:Batman) and Robin, while the second was the archenemy to [Nightwing](:Dick_Grayson). The latest version first appeared in the pages of the series *[52](:52_%28comics%29)* wherein he is directed into battle against [Lex Luthor](:Lex_Luthor)'s [team of superheroes](:Infinity%2C_Inc%2E)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
