<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Flashback_(comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Flashback** (**Gardner Monroe**) is a fictional [mutant](:Mutant_%28Marvel_Comics%29) character appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). His first appearance was in *[Alpha Flight](:Alpha_Flight_%28comic_book%29)* #1."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
