<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Firebrand_(Marvel_Comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Firebrand** (**Gary Gilbert**) is a [supervillain](:Supervillain) in the [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics) [universe](:Marvel_Universe). A superpowered enforcer for corrupt [industrialist](:Industrialist) [Justin Hammer](:Justin_Hammer), Firebrand is a former activist who turned to violence after believing peaceful protest produced no results."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Onyxx> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Agent> .
