<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nekron> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Nekron** is a [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [comic books](:Comic_book) published by [DC Comics](:DC_Comics), specifically those related to [Green Lantern](:Green_Lantern). Created by [Mike W. Barr](:Mike_W%2E_Barr), [Len Wein](:Len_Wein) and [Joe Staton](:Joe_Staton), the character, who exists as an embodiment of [Death](:Death_%28personification%29), first appeared in *[Tales of the Green Lantern Corps](:Green_Lantern)* #2 (June 1981). He is the primary antagonist in the 2009-2010 *[Blackest Night](:Blackest_Night)* storyline."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
