<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Fabian_Cortez> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Fabian Cortez** is a fictional [mutant](:Mutant_%28Marvel_Comics%29) [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). The character is depicted as an adversary of the [X-Men](:X-Men). Created by writer [Chris Claremont](:Chris_Claremont) and writer/illustrator [Jim Lee](:Jim_Lee), he first appeared in *[X-Men](:X-Men%3A_Legacy)* #1 (October 1991)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
