<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Superman_(Kal_Kent)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Kal Kent** is a [superhero](:Superhero) who appears in the [DC Comics](:DC_Comics), created by [Grant Morrison](:Grant_Morrison). He is the [Superman](:Superman) of the [853rd century](:DC_One_Million). He is also a descendant of the original Superman himself. He first appeared in *JLA* #15 (February 1998)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
