<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Swordsman_(character)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Swordsman** (**Jacques Duquesne**) is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). His first appearance was in *[The Avengers](:The_Avengers_%28comic_book%29)* #19 (August 1965) and was created by [Stan Lee](:Stan_Lee) and [Don Heck](:Don_Heck). Although he was first introduced as an enemy of [Hawkeye](:Hawkeye_%28Clint_Barton%29) and the Avengers, the character has since appeared as both a supervillain and a superhero.[Tony Dalton](:Tony_Dalton) portrays a variation of the character, renamed **Jack Duquesne**, in the [Marvel Cinematic Universe](:Marvel_Cinematic_Universe) / [Disney+](:Disney%2B) series *[Hawkeye](:Hawkeye_%282021_TV_series%29)* (2021)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
