<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chester_Gould> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Chester Gould (/ɡuːld/; November 20, 1900 – May 11, 1985) was an American cartoonist, best known as the creator of the Dick Tracy comic strip, which he wrote and drew from 1931 to 1977, incorporating numerous colorful and monstrous villains."@en .
