<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Foreigner_(character)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Foreigner** is a fictional [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). He was formerly married to [Silver Sable](:Silver_Sable).The Foreigner is a mercenary and assassin. Although he has no superhuman abilities, he has trained his body to be in absolute peak physical condition, is among the greatest martial arts practitioners in the Marvel Universe, and as a professional assassin, who has evaded detection by various international law enforcement agencies, is highly intelligent. He is often depicted as being exceedingly competent."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
