<http://dbpedia.org/resource/David_Anthony_Kraft> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**David Anthony Kraft** (May 31, 1952 – May 19, 2021) was an American comic book writer, publisher, and critic. He was primarily known for his long-running journal of interviews and criticism, *Comics Interview*, as well as for work for Marvel Comics in the late 1970s and early 1980s."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
