<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Anton_Arcane> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Anton Arcane** is a supervillain appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_books) by [DC Comics](:DC_Comics). the character first appeared in *[Swamp Thing](:Swamp_Thing_%28comic_book%29)* #2 (January 1973), and was created by writer [Len Wein](:Len_Wein) and artist [Bernie Wrightson](:Bernie_Wrightson). He is the [archenemy](:Archenemy) of the [Swamp Thing](:Swamp_Thing), the protagonist of the comics."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
