<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Proteus_(Marvel_Comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Kevin MacTaggert**, best known as **Proteus** and also called **Mutant X**, is a [character](:Character_%28arts%29) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). The character is commonly associated with the [X-Men](:X-Men).Kevin was the [mutant](:Mutant_%28Marvel_Comics%29) son of Scottish genetic researcher [Moira MacTaggert](:Moira_MacTaggert) and politician Joseph MacTaggert. Kevin had reality-warping and [possession](:Spirit_possession) powers and lived most of his life in forced seclusion at his mother's [Muir Island](:Muir_Island) research facility.His attempt to break free and find his father made up a classic 1979–80 *The Uncanny X-Men* storyline that was adapted in the [1990s *X-Men* animated series](:X-Men%3A_The_Animated_Series). In 2009, Proteus was ranked as [IGN](:IGN)'s 77th-greatest villain of all time."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
