<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Lazarus_Churchyard> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Lazarus Churchyard** is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character) in a [British comics](:British_comics) series, created in 1991 by [Warren Ellis](:Warren_Ellis) and illustrated by [Matt Brooker](:Matt_Brooker) under the [pseudonym](:Pseudonym) D'Israeli. The stories are [cyberpunk](:Cyberpunk) in theme, although Ellis himself does not consider it so and prefers to call it \"decadent SF\"."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
