<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hawkman_(Fel_Andar)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Fel Andar** is a [DC Comics](:DC_Comics) character who also called himself **[Hawkman](:Hawkman)**. There are two different versions of Fel Andar: the pre-[Hawkworld](:Hawkworld) version (named **Fell Andar**) was created by [Tony Isabella](:Tony_Isabella) and [Richard Howell](:Richard_Howell_%28comics%29), while the post-Hawkworld version was created by [John Ostrander](:John_Ostrander) and [Graham Nolan](:Graham_Nolan).Fel Andar was created after DC Comics [rebooted](:Reboot_%28fiction%29) the Hawkman character after publication of the 1989 *Hawkworld* miniseries, as a stand-in for [Katar Hol](:Hawkman_%28Katar_Hol%29) in Katar's post-Crisis, pre-Hawkworld adventures, including his brief membership with [Justice League International](:Justice_League_International)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
