<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Curt_Swan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Douglas Curtis Swan** (February 17, 1920 – June 17, 1996) was an American [comics artist](:Comics_artist). The artist most associated with [Superman](:Superman) during the period fans call the [Bronze Age of Comic Books](:Bronze_Age_of_Comic_Books), Swan produced hundreds of covers and stories from the 1950s through the 1980s."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
