<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Viper_(Madame_Hydra)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Viper (real name Ophelia Sarkissian, formerly known as Madame Hydra) is a supervillain appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics. She is a foe of the Avengers and the X-Men. Viper was featured in the 2013 film The Wolverine, played by Russian actress Svetlana Khodchenkova. A variation of the character was portrayed by Mallory Jansen in the fourth season of the Marvel Cinematic Universe television series Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.."@en .
