<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Chuck_Austen> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Chuck Austen (born Chuck Beckum) is an American comic book writer and artist, television writer and producer. In the comics industry, he is known for his work on U.S. War Machine, The Avengers, JLA, Action Comics and the X-Men franchise, and in television, he is known for co-creating the animated TV series Tripping the Rift and producing the first season of Steven Universe and acting as a co-showrunner on She-Ra and the Princesses of Power."@en .
