<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Karen_Page> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Karen Page** is a [fictional](:Fiction) [character](:Character_%28arts%29) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). She is also [Daredevil](:Daredevil_%28Marvel_Comics_character%29)'s longest-running love interest.Karen Page was portrayed by [Ellen Pompeo](:Ellen_Pompeo) in the 2003 feature film *[Daredevil](:Daredevil_%28film%29)*, and by [Deborah Ann Woll](:Deborah_Ann_Woll) in the [Marvel Television](:Marvel_Television) [streaming television](:Streaming_television) productions *[Daredevil](:Daredevil_%28TV_series%29)*, *[The Defenders](:The_Defenders_%28miniseries%29)*, and *[The Punisher](:The_Punisher_%28TV_series%29)*, set in the [Marvel Cinematic Universe](:Marvel_Cinematic_Universe) (MCU)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
