<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Spirit_King> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Spirit King is a character in the fictional DC Universe; he was initially an adversary of the original Mister Terrific, but later expanded to be a threat to the entire Justice Society, particularly the Spectre and the Flash. The character was created for a murder mystery story in the 1970s and retroactively introduced into the fictional history of the character Mister Terrific."@en .
