<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Paul_Kupperberg> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Paul Kupperberg** (born June 14, 1955) is an American writer and comics editor. He is currently a writer and executive editor at Charlton Neo Comics and Pix-C Webcomics, and a contributing author with Crazy 8 Press. Formerly, he was an editor for [DC Comics](:DC_Comics) and executive editor of [Weekly World News](:Weekly_World_News), as well as a writer of novels, comic books, and [newspaper strips](:Comic_strip)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
