<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ramona_Fradon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ramona Fradon (born October 2, 1926) is an American comics artist known for her work illustrating Aquaman and Brenda Starr, and co-creating the superhero Metamorpho. Her career began in 1950."@en .
