<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Andy_Lanning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Andy Lanning is an English comic book writer and inker, known for his work for Marvel Comics and DC Comics, and for his collaboration with Dan Abnett."@en .
