<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Aries_(character)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The incarnations of **Aries** are fictional [supervillains](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). The characters were usually depicted as members of incarnations of the supervillain group, the [Zodiac](:Zodiac_%28comics%29).In the history of the [Marvel Universe](:Marvel_Universe), seven different [characters](:Fictional_character) have assumed the role of Aries. All of them have been members of the villainous Zodiac and used horns on their head to ram their opponents. The third Aries was a [Life Model Decoy](:Life_Model_Decoy) created by [Jake Fury](:Scorpio_%28Marvel_Comics%29). The second and fourth Aries' were [African-American](:African-American)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
