<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ron_Frenz> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Ronald Wade Frenz** (born February 1, 1960) is an American [comics artist](:Comics_artist) known for his work for [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). He is well known for his 1980s work on *The Amazing Spider-Man* and later for his work on *[Spider-Girl](:Spider-Girl_%28Mayday_Parker%29)* whom he co-created with writer [Tom DeFalco](:Tom_DeFalco). Frenz and DeFalco had earlier co-created the [New Warriors](:New_Warriors) in the pages of *[Thor](:Thor_%28Marvel_Comics%29)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
