<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dave_Gibbons> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**David Chester Gibbons** (born 14 April 1949) is an English [comics artist](:Comics_artist), writer and sometimes [letterer](:Letterer). He is best known for his collaborations with writer [Alan Moore](:Alan_Moore), which include the miniseries *[Watchmen](:Watchmen)* and the Superman story \"[For the Man Who Has Everything](:For_the_Man_Who_Has_Everything)\". He was an artist for *[2000 AD](:2000_AD_%28comics%29)*, for which he contributed a large body of work from its first issue in 1977."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
