<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bruce_Timm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bruce Walter Timm (born February 5, 1961) is an American artist, character designer, animator, writer, producer and voice actor. He is best known for his contributions building the modern DC Comics animated franchise, most notably Batman: The Animated Series (1992–1995) and the subsequent DC Animated Universe, for which Timm made most of the character designs. Timm and Paul Dini co-created the characters Harley Quinn and Terry McGinnis."@en .
