<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Budd_Root> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Budd Root (born 1958 in Heidelberg, Germany) is an American cartoonist, and creator of the independent comic book Cavewoman, published by Root's company Basement Comics/. Root is one of the premiere contemporary \"good girl\" artists, with an art style similar to Art Adams.'"@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Herb_Trimpe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Herbert William Trimpe (/trɪmp/; May 26, 1939 – April 13, 2015) was an American comics artist and occasional writer, best known as the seminal 1970s artist on The Incredible Hulk and as the first artist to draw for publication the character Wolverine, who later became a breakout star of the X-Men."@en .
