<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Sal_Buscema> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Sal Buscema (/bjuːˈsɛmə/; Italian: [buʃˈʃɛːma]; born Silvio Buscema, January 26, 1936) is an American comics artist, primarily for Marvel Comics, where he enjoyed a ten-year run as artist of The Incredible Hulk and an eight-year run as artist of The Spectacular Spider-Man. He is the younger brother of comics artist John Buscema."@en .
