<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Steve_Englehart> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Steve Englehart** (; born April 22, 1947) is an American writer of [comic books](:Comic_book) and novels. He is best known for his work at [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics) and [DC Comics](:DC_Comics) in the 1970s and 1980s. His [pseudonyms](:Pseudonyms) have included **John Harkness** and **Cliff Garnett**."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
