<http://dbpedia.org/resource/TNT_(character)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**TNT** is a [DC Comics](:DC_Comics) [superhero](:Superhero) from the 1940s. TNT and his side-kick [Dan the Dyna-Mite](:Dan_the_Dyna-Mite) were created by [Mort Weisinger](:Mort_Weisinger) for DC Comics, and made their debut in *[Star Spangled Comics](:Star_Spangled_Comics)* #7 (April 1942).The \"human hand grenades\" had a short lived career during the [Golden Age of Comic Books](:Golden_Age_of_Comic_Books), reappearing occasionally in reprint form during the 1970s, returning in *[Super Friends](:Super_Friends)* #12, and appearing from time to time in *[All-Star Squadron](:All-Star_Squadron)* and its Post-Crisis sequel, *[Young All-Stars](:Young_All-Stars)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
