<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mike_Mignola> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mike Mignola (/mɪɡˈnoʊlə/; born September 16, 1960) is an American comics artist and writer best known for creating Hellboy for Dark Horse Comics, part of a shared universe of titles including B.P.R.D., Abe Sapien, Lobster Johnson, Witchfinder and various spinoffs. He has also created other supernatural and paranormal themed titles for Dark Horse including Baltimore, Joe Golem and The Amazing Screw-On Head."@en .
