<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Batman_of_Zur-En-Arrh> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Batman of Zur-En-Arrh is a fictional character in the DC Comics universe. In the Silver Age story, the character is an alien named Tlano from the planet Zur-En-Arrh who decided to become a version of Batman for his own planet. The character's reappearance in the 2000s rebranded him as a violent and unhinged backup personality of Bruce Wayne."@en .
