<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Superman> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Superman is a superhero who appears in American comic books published by DC Comics. The character was created by writer Jerry Siegel and artist Joe Shuster, and debuted in the comic book Action Comics #1 (cover-dated June 1938 and published April 18, 1938). Superman has been adapted to a number of other media, which includes radio serials, novels, films, television shows, and theater."@en .
