<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ghost_(Nedor_Comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Ghost is a fictional character, a superhero that appeared in comic books published by Nedor Comics. His first appearance was in Thrilling Comics #3 (April 1940). The character is loosely based on the pulp hero created by G.T. Fleming-Roberts, who was variously known as the Ghost, the Ghost Detective, and the Green Ghost. The character was later revived by writer Alan Moore for America's Best Comics."@en .
