<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Werner_von_Strucker> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Werner von Strucker** is a fictional character appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics).The character has seen a live-action adaptation in the [Marvel Cinematic Universe](:Marvel_Cinematic_Universe) TV series *[Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.](:Agents_of_S%2EH%2EI%2EE%2EL%2ED%2E)* portrayed by [Spencer Treat Clark](:Spencer_Treat_Clark) in the third and fifth seasons."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
