<http://dbpedia.org/resource/April_O'Neil> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**April O'Neil** is a fictional [character](:Character_%28arts%29) from the *[Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles)* comics. She is the first human ally of the Ninja Turtles. Her main love interest in the series was [Casey Jones](:Casey_Jones_%28Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles%29).April made her first appearance in the [Mirage comic series](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%28Mirage_Studios%29) in 1984 as a [computer](:Computer) [programmer](:Programmer). She was later portrayed as a strong-willed [news reporter](:Journalist) in the Turtles' [first animated series](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%281987_TV_series%29), as a warrior in the *[Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles Adventures](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_Adventures)* comic produced by [Archie Comics](:Archie_Comics), and various other personas in different *TMNT* media.April was later voiced by [Renae Jacobs](:Renae_Jacobs) in the [1987 animated series](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%281987_TV_series%29), by [Veronica Taylor](:Veronica_Taylor) in the [2003 animated series](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%282003_TV_series%29), and by [Sarah Michelle Gellar](:Sarah_Michelle_Gellar) in the 2007 film *[TMNT](:TMNT_%28film%29)*. In the [2012 animated series](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%282012_TV_series%29), April is voiced by [Mae Whitman](:Mae_Whitman), in which she is her late teens. In film, she has been portrayed by [Judith Hoag](:Judith_Hoag) ([1990](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%281990_film%29)), [Paige Turco](:Paige_Turco) ([1991](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_II%3A_The_Secret_of_the_Ooze) and [1993](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III%29), [Megan Fox](:Megan_Fox) ([2014](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_%282014_film%29) and [2016](:Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles%3A_Out_of_the_Shadows%29) and by [Malina Weissman](:Malina_Weissman) as the younger version of the character in the 2014 film."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
