<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Rapido_(comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Rapido (Roussel Dupont)** is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character), a [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). Created by [Dan Abnett](:Dan_Abnett), [Andy Lanning](:Andy_Lanning), and [Doug Braithwaite](:Doug_Braithwaite), the character made his first appearance in *[The Punisher](:The_Punisher_%281987_series%29)* Vol. 2, #65 (June 1992). He is an enemy of the [Punisher](:Punisher)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
