<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Herb_Trimpe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Herbert William Trimpe** (; May 26, 1939 – April 13, 2015) was an [American](:Americans) [comics artist](:Comics_artist) and occasional writer, best known as the seminal 1970s artist on *[The Incredible Hulk](:The_Incredible_Hulk_%28comic_book%29)* and as the first artist to draw for publication the character [Wolverine](:Wolverine_%28character%29), who later became a breakout star of the [X-Men](:X-Men)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
