<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Superman_(Earth-One)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Superman** of [Earth-One](:Earth-One) is the incarnation of [Superman](:Superman) that existed during the [Silver Age](:Silver_Age_of_Comic_Books) and [Bronze Age](:Bronze_Age_of_Comic_Books) publications of [DC Comics](:DC_Comics). He is also known by the following names: Silver Age Superman, Bronze Age Superman, and Pre-Crisis Superman."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
