<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Joe_Staton> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Joe Staton** ( born January 19, 1948) is an American [comics artist](:Comics_artist) and writer. He co-created the [Bronze Age](:Bronze_Age_of_Comic_Books) [Huntress (Helena Wayne)](:Huntress_%28Helena_Wayne%29), as well as the third [Huntress (Helena Bertinelli)](:Huntress_%28Helena_Bertinelli%29) and the [Omega Men](:Omega_Men) for [DC Comics](:DC_Comics). He was the artist of the *[Dick Tracy](:Dick_Tracy)* comic strip from 2011 to October 2021."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
