<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Eddie_Fyers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Eddie Fyers** is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character), appearing in various [comic book](:Comic_book) series published by [DC Comics](:DC_Comics).Edward Fyers appeared in the [first season](:Arrow_%28season_1%29) and [final season](:Arrow_%28season_8%29) of *[Arrow](:Arrow_%28TV_series%29)*, played by Sebastian Dunn set in the [Arrowverse](:Arrowverse)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
