<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hybrid_(Jimmy_Marks)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Hybrid** (**James \"Jimmy\" Marks**) is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character), a [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). He first appeared in *[Rom](:Rom_%28comics%29)* #17 (April 1981) by writer [Bill Mantlo](:Bill_Mantlo) and artist [Sal Buscema](:Sal_Buscema)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
