<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Robot_Archie> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Robot Archie** is the name of a [fictional](:Fictional) [comic book](:Comic_book) character from *[Lion](:Lion_%28comic%29)*, a weekly British boys' adventure title."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
