<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dick_Dillin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Richard Allen Dillin** (December 17, 1928 – March 1, 1980) was an [American](:Americans) [comics artist](:Comics_artist) best known for a 12-year run as the [penciler](:Penciler) of the [DC Comics](:DC_Comics) [superhero](:Superhero)-team series *[Justice League of America](:Justice_League)*. He drew 115 issues from 1968 until his death in 1980."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
