<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Joe_Kelly_(comics_writer)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Joseph Kelly (born 1971) is an American comic book writer, penciler and editor who has written such titles as Deadpool, Uncanny X-Men, Action Comics, and JLA. As part of the comics creator group Man of Action Studios, Kelly is one of the creators of the animated series Ben 10."@en .
