<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Fabian_Nicieza> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Fabian Nicieza** (born December 31, 1961) is an [Argentine-American](:Argentine_Americans) comic book writer and [editor](:Editing) who is best known for his work on [Marvel](:Marvel_Comics) titles such as *[X-Men](:X-Men)*, *[X-Force](:X-Force)*, *[New Warriors](:New_Warriors)*, *[Nomad](:Nomad_%28comics%29)*, *[Cable](:Cable_%28comics%29)*, *[Deadpool](:Deadpool)* and *[Thunderbolts](:Thunderbolts_%28comics%29)*, for all of which he helped create numerous characters, among them [Deadpool](:Deadpool), [Domino](:Domino_%28comics%29), [Shatterstar](:Shatterstar), and [Silhouette](:Silhouette_%28comics%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
