<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Bob_Haney> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Robert Gilbert Haney, Jr.** (March 15, 1926 – November 25, 2004) was an [American](:Americans) [comic book](:Comic_book) writer, best known for his work for [DC Comics](:DC_Comics). He co-created the [Teen Titans](:Teen_Titans) as well as characters such as [Metamorpho](:Metamorpho), [Eclipso](:Eclipso), [Cain](:Cain_and_Abel_%28comics%29), and the [Super-Sons](:Super-Sons)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
