<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Ghost_(Nedor_Comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The **Ghost** is a [fictional character](:Character_%28arts%29), a [superhero](:Superhero) that appeared in [comic books](:Comic_book) published by [Nedor Comics](:Nedor_Comics). His [first appearance](:First_appearance) was in *Thrilling Comics* #3 (April 1940). The character is loosely based on the pulp hero created by G.T. Fleming-Roberts, who was variously known as the Ghost, the Ghost Detective, and the Green Ghost.The character was later revived by writer [Alan Moore](:Alan_Moore) for [America's Best Comics](:America%27s_Best_Comics_%28DC%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
