<http://dbpedia.org/resource/El_Aguila> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**El Águila** (**Alejandro Montoya**) is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). El Águila is patterned after the literary hero [Zorro](:Zorro). His name is [Spanish](:Spanish_language) for \"the [eagle](:Eagle)\".The character made its live-action debut in the [Marvel Cinematic Universe](:Marvel_Cinematic_Universe) television series *[She-Hulk: Attorney at Law](:She-Hulk%3A_Attorney_at_Law)*, played by Joseph Castillo-Midyett."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
