<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Viper_(Madame_Hydra)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Viper** (real name **Ophelia Sarkissian**, formerly known as **[Madame Hydra](:Madame_Hydra)**) is a [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). She is a foe of the [Avengers](:Avengers_%28comics%29) and the [X-Men](:X-Men).Viper was featured in the 2013 film *[The Wolverine](:The_Wolverine_%28film%29)*, played by Russian actress [Svetlana Khodchenkova](:Svetlana_Khodchenkova). A variation of the character was portrayed by [Mallory Jansen](:Mallory_Jansen) in the [fourth season](:Agents_of_S%2EH%2EI%2EE%2EL%2ED%2E_%28season_4%29) of the [Marvel Cinematic Universe](:Marvel_Cinematic_Universe) television series *[Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.](:Agents_of_S%2EH%2EI%2EE%2EL%2ED%2E)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
