<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Andrew_Chord> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Andrew Chord** is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). He is African American. His first appearance was in *[Thor](:Thor_%28Marvel_Comics%29)* #411. Chord was the mentor of [Night Thrasher](:Night_Thrasher) and the [New Warriors](:New_Warriors). He is also the father of [Silhouette](:Silhouette_%28comics%29) and [Midnight's Fire](:Midnight%27s_Fire) and the son-in-law of Warriors villain [Tai](:Tai_%28comics%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
