<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Avengelyne> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Avengelyne** [uh-van'-jah-leen] is a [fictional](:Character_%28arts%29) [Image Universe](:Image_Universe) [comic book](:Comic_book) character created by [Rob Liefeld](:Rob_Liefeld) and Cathy Christian. Avengelyne is an [angel](:Angel) who fights the forces of evil and often finds herself face-to-face with [demons](:Demons) and [monsters](:Monsters)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
