<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Joe_Staton> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Joe Staton (/steɪtən/ born January 19, 1948) is an American comics artist and writer. He co-created the Bronze Age Huntress (Helena Wayne), as well as the third Huntress (Helena Bertinelli) and the Omega Men for DC Comics. He was the artist of the Dick Tracy comic strip from 2011 to October 2021."@en .
