<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Dick_Dillin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Richard Allen Dillin (December 17, 1928 – March 1, 1980) was an American comics artist best known for a 12-year run as the penciler of the DC Comics superhero-team series Justice League of America. He drew 115 issues from 1968 until his death in 1980."@en .
