<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mantra_(comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mantra is an American comic book series written by Mike Barr, mainly penciled by Terry Dodson and published by Malibu Comics in the mid-1990s, until it was purchased by Marvel Comics. Adam Hughes is credited for the character designs. After the purchase, the title was cancelled after 24 issues and revamped in a new version, with a new protagonist. Mantra is the name of the lead character, an Ultra (superhero) within Malibu's Ultraverse line of comics."@en .
