<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Mark_Bagley> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mark Bagley (/ˈbæɡli/; born August 7, 1957) is an American comics artist. He has worked for Marvel Comics on such titles as The Amazing Spider-Man, Thunderbolts, New Warriors, and Ultimate Spider-Man and for DC Comics on Justice League of America, Batman and Trinity."@en .
