<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Slayback_(comic_book_character)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Slayback** is a [fictional character](:Character_%28arts%29) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). Primarily an enemy of [Deadpool](:Deadpool), the character exists within Marvel's main [shared universe](:Shared_universe), known as the [Marvel Universe](:Marvel_Universe). Created by writer [Fabian Nicieza](:Fabian_Nicieza) and artist [Joe Madureira](:Joe_Madureira), the character first appeared in *Deadpool: The Circle Chase* #1 (August 1993)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
