<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Onyxx> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Onyxx** (**Sidney Green**) is a [fictional](:Fictional) [mutant](:Mutant_%28Marvel_Comics%29) appearing in comic books published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). He first appeared in *[X-Men](:X-Men%3A_Legacy)*, vol. 2 #171 and was created by [Peter Milligan](:Peter_Milligan) and [Salvador Larroca](:Salvador_Larroca)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
