<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Matthew_Cable> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Matthew Joseph Cable is a fictional character appearing in DC Comics' Swamp Thing series. Introduced in Swamp Thing (Volume 1) in November 1972, he dies and is later resurrected as Dream's raven in Neil Gaiman's rendition of The Sandman. Matt Cable was played by Henderson Wade in the television series based on the comic book series of the same name for the DC streaming service."@en .
