<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Curt_Swan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Douglas Curtis Swan (February 17, 1920 – June 17, 1996) was an American comics artist. The artist most associated with Superman during the period fans call the Bronze Age of Comic Books, Swan produced hundreds of covers and stories from the 1950s through the 1980s."@en .
<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tiger_Shark_(Marvel_Comics)> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Tiger Shark** (**Todd Arliss**) is a [fictional character](:Fictional_character), a [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
