<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Rulah,_Jungle_Goddess> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Rulah, Jungle Goddess is a fictional character, a jungle girl, in comic books published by Fox Feature Syndicate. She first appeared in Zoot Comics #7 (June 1947). Matt Baker designed her, before Jack Kamen and Graham Ingels helped develop her image. Rulah was inspired by a boom in jungle girl comics in the late 1940s, headed by Fiction House's Sheena, Queen of the Jungle."@en .
