<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Steve_Dillon> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Steve Dillon (22 March 1962 – 22 October 2016) was a British comic book artist, best known for his work with writer Garth Ennis on Hellblazer, Preacher and The Punisher."@en .
