<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Necrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Necrom** is a [fictional](:Fictional_character) [supervillain](:Supervillain) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). The character has been depicted as an enemy of the British superhero group [Excalibur](:Excalibur_%28comics%29). Created by writer/artist [Alan Davis](:Alan_Davis), the character first appeared in *[Excalibur](:Excalibur_%28comic_book%29)* #46 (January, 1992), which depicted him as a powerful sorcerer who sought the power of the cosmic entity known as the [Phoenix Force](:Phoenix_Force_%28comics%29), with which he threatened the entire [multiverse](:Multiverse_%28Marvel_Comics%29)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
