<http://dbpedia.org/resource/John_Wagner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "John Wagner (born 1949) is an American-born British comics writer. Alongside Pat Mills, he helped revitalise British comics in the 1970s, and continues to be active in the British comics industry, occasionally also working in American comics. He is best known as the co-creator, with artist Carlos Ezquerra, of the character Judge Dredd."@en .
