<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tony_Isabella> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Tony Isabella** (born December 22, 1951) is an [American](:Americans) [comic book](:Comic_book) writer, editor, actor, artist and critic, known as the creator and writer of [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics)' [Black Goliath](:Bill_Foster_%28comics%29); [DC Comics](:DC_Comics)' first major [African-American](:African-American) [superhero](:Superhero), [Black Lightning](:Black_Lightning); and as a columnist and critic for the *[Comics Buyer's Guide](:Comics_Buyer%27s_Guide)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
