<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Willie_Lumpkin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**William Lemuel \"Willie\" Lumpkin** is a [fictional](:Fictional_character) [supporting character](:Supporting_character) appearing in [American comic books](:American_comic_book) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). The character is best known as the [mailman](:Mail_carrier) of the [Fantastic Four](:Fantastic_Four) in their [self-titled comic book](:Fantastic_Four_%28comic_book%29).Willie Lumpkin was portrayed by [Stan Lee](:Stan_Lee) in the 2005 film *[Fantastic Four](:Fantastic_Four_%282005_film%29)*."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
