<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Nightmask> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Nightmask** is a name and identity used by several [fictional](:Fictional) characters who appear in [comic books](:Comic_books) published by [Marvel Comics](:Marvel_Comics). The first character to bear the name, **Keith Remsen**, was created by writer [Archie Goodwin](:Archie_Goodwin_%28comics%29), and first appeared in *Nightmask* #1 (November [1986](:1986_in_comics%29), a series which was published under Marvel's [New Universe](:New_Universe) imprint. Subsequentcharacters bearing the name were introduced in the 2006 series *[newuniversal](:Newuniversal)*, and as part of Marvel's 2012 rebranding, [Marvel NOW!](:Marvel_NOW%21)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
