<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Richard_F._Outcault> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Richard Felton Outcault (/ˈaʊtkɔːlt/; January 14, 1863 – September 25, 1928) was an American cartoonist. He was the creator of the series The Yellow Kid and Buster Brown and is considered a key pioneer of the modern comic strip."@en .
